@startuml
title Multi-layer LTE + Multi-layer NR (Dense Network)

actor UE
participant LTE as "eNB (Macro)"
participant NR1 as "gNB1 (Mid-Band)"
participant NR2 as "gNB2 (mmWave)"

UE -> LTE: RRC Connection Setup
LTE -> NR1: EN-DC Addition Request
NR1 -> LTE: EN-DC Addition Request Ack
LTE -> UE: RRC Reconfiguration (Add NR1)
UE -> NR1: RRC Connection Setup
UE -> LTE: RRC Reconfiguration Complete
LTE -> NR1: Data Split Activated
alt NR2 triggered
    LTE -> NR2: EN-DC Addition Request
    NR2 -> LTE: Ack
    LTE -> UE: RRC Reconfiguration (Add NR2)
    UE -> NR2: RRC Connection Setup
    UE -> LTE: RRC Reconfiguration Complete
    LTE -> NR2: Data Split Activated
end
@enduml
